<title>POLAND: VISTULA OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 1.2 MLN.</title>
<headline>VISTULA OCT NET FLAT AT PLN 1.2 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results October</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     1.22 vs   1.15</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	 1.95 vs   2.23</p>
<p> Operating profit     1.55 vs   1.75</p>
<p> Sales		    9.70 vs   9.00</p>
<p>JANUARY-OCTOBER</p>
<p> Net profit	     8.84 vs   7.24</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit	15.25 vs  11.24</p>
<p> Operating profit    10.07 vs   8.71</p>
<p> Sales		   82.18 vs  70.85</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish garment maker is Vistula SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
